# r1115 phase 7, boot NB: SQ-DEP-02 (rerun 5.2) and SQ-HOP-01, Creative Brewing removed (so no Brewin' or Vinery).
# Generated by tools/scratch_query/dep_gen_p7.py. Group A (superflat); installed mods/ jars (NOSWAP=1).
# Before boot: rm OUT/srv/mods/creativebrewing-*.jar; probes as p7_a0.qb.
pace 1

## P7-setup | gamerules, forceload, probe check (not a test row)
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> time set noon
> forceload add 92 92 108 108
sleep 3
> zc3 bstate 100 -61 100
waitlog \[c3\] done 20
> zhh2 lootroll minecraft:chests/simple_dungeon 1
waitlog \[zhh2\] done 20

## SQ-DEP-02 | no Brewing: Done, no ERR line naming brewinandchewin or vinery, placed_vegetable_omelet absent, corn maze gives items
bootreject CoasterBlockEntityRenderer|CoasterRendererOffset.*(rror|ail)
# Create Central Kitchen's own optional KegBlockEntityMixin logs a mixin 'Error loading class: umpaz/brewinandchewin/...'
# WARN without Brewin' (third party, r1114 and r1115): not ours, excluded
bootreject (?i)^(?!.*\[mixin/\]: Error loading class).*brewinandchewin.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)
bootreject @Mixin target umpaz\.brewinandchewin\.\S+ was not found (?!create_central_kitchen)
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory
shell test "$(ls mods | grep -c '^creativebrewing')" = 0 && echo "brewing jar gone"
shell grep -nE "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "brewinandchewin|vinery" | cut -c1-300 | head -8; echo "ERR lines naming brewinandchewin or vinery: $(grep -E "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -ciE "brewinandchewin|vinery")"
shell test "$(grep -E "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -ciE "brewinandchewin|vinery")" = 0
> setblock 100 -60 100 creativedelight:placed_vegetable_omelet
> zq blocks placed_vegetable_omelet
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] blocks id creativedelight:placed_vegetable_omelet
> zhh2 lootroll hearthandharvest:chests/corn_maze 5
waitlog \[zhh2\] done 30
expect \[zhh2\] lootroll hearthandharvest:chests/corn_maze rolls 5, ids [1-9]
shell grep -nE "vinery:[a-z_]*grape_bush" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-260 | head -5; echo "grape bush lines: $(grep -cE 'vinery:[a-z_]*grape_bush' logs/latest.log)"
shell grep -nE "Unknown loot table called" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-260 | head -6
shell grep -iE "error" logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -iE "brewin|vinery" | head -5 | cut -c1-240; true
look the setblock fails (no such block); grape bush lines recorded for TODO creativesplit/deps #27 (not a FAIL)

## SQ-HOP-01 | no Brewing: no hops item, salad, bag, wild hops or hops vine registered; no hearthandharvest:hops error
> zq items hearthandharvest:hops
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] items id hearthandharvest:hops
> zq items hearthandharvest:wild_hops
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] items id hearthandharvest:wild_hops
> zq blocks hearthandharvest:hops_vine
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] blocks id hearthandharvest:hops_vine
shell grep -nE "hearthandharvest:(hops|wild_hops)" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-260 | head -8; echo "hops lines: $(cat logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -cE 'hearthandharvest:(hops|wild_hops)')"
look zq lists no hops item / block (hops_salad and hops_bag are covered by the hearthandharvest:hops text query); no hops error line
